<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>竹北食堂 — 九降風吹過的餐桌</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=LXGW+WenKai+TC&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#14273F;        /* 墨靛 */
  --indigo:#24466E;     /* 藍衫靛 */
  --indigo-soft:#2E5484;
  --persimmon:#DE7A34;  /* 柿餅橘 */
  --rice:#FAF6EE;       /* 米紙 */
  --straw:#E6DCC6;      /* 稻稈 */
  --tea:#6B7A5E;        /* 茶綠 */
  --line:rgba(20,39,63,.14);
  --sidebar-w:272px;
  --display:'LXGW WenKai TC',serif;
  --body:'Noto Sans TC',sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  font-family:var(--body);
  background:var(--rice);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.75;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}

/* ---------- App shell ---------- */
.app{display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--sidebar-w) 1fr;height:100vh;overflow:hidden}

/* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
.sidebar{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ink) 0%,var(--indigo) 130%);
  color:#EDF2F7;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  padding:20px 14px 16px;
  overflow-y:auto;
}
.brand{
  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;
  padding:2px 10px 18px;
}
.brand b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px}
.brand span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#9FB3CB}
.new-chat{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  color:#F4F0E6;border-radius:10px;
  padding:9px 12px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:var(--body);width:100%;
  transition:background .15s;
}
.new-chat:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
.new-chat svg{flex:none}
.nav-label{
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8DA2BC;
  margin:22px 10px 6px;user-select:none;
}
.nav-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
  padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;
  font-size:13.5px;color:#D8E1EC;cursor:pointer;
  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;
  transition:background .12s;border:none;background:none;width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:var(--body);
}
.nav-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
.nav-item.active{background:rgba(222,122,52,.22);color:#FFE4CC}
.nav-item .dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--persimmon);flex:none}
.nav-item small{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:#8DA2BC}
.side-foot{
  margin-top:auto;padding:14px 10px 2px;
  font-size:11px;color:#7E93AE;letter-spacing:.5px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
}

/* ---------- Main ---------- */
.main{position:relative;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;scroll-behavior:smooth}
.topbar{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  padding:14px 34px;
  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rice) 88%,transparent);
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.topbar .crumbs{font-size:13px;color:#5B6B80;letter-spacing:1px}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 9px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}

/* ---------- Hero ---------- */
.hero{padding:64px 34px 30px;max-width:880px}
.eyebrow{
  font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--tea);
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
h1{
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px);
  line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:2px;
}
h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--persimmon)}
.hero p{margin-top:16px;max-width:560px;color:#44556C;font-weight:300}

/* 九降風 — signature wind strokes */
.wind{position:relative;height:34px;max-width:880px;margin:6px 34px 0;overflow:hidden}
.wind i{
  position:absolute;height:1px;border-radius:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--persimmon) 30%,transparent);
  opacity:.55;animation:blow 7s linear infinite;
}
.wind i:nth-child(1){top:8px;width:46%;animation-delay:0s}
.wind i:nth-child(2){top:17px;width:64%;animation-delay:1.6s;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--indigo) 30%,transparent)}
.wind i:nth-child(3){top:26px;width:38%;animation-delay:3.4s}
@keyframes blow{
  0%{transform:translateX(-70%)}
  100%{transform:translateX(240%)}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .wind i{animation:none;transform:none;left:10%}
}

/* ---------- Categories ---------- */
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;padding:26px 34px 6px;max-width:880px}
.chip{
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;
  padding:6px 15px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;
  background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);
  transition:all .15s;
}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--indigo);color:var(--indigo)}
.chip.on{background:var(--indigo);border-color:var(--indigo);color:#FAF6EE}

/* ---------- Cards ---------- */
.grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));
  gap:18px;padding:22px 34px 60px;max-width:960px;
}
.card{
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:14px;padding:20px 20px 16px;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;
  transition:transform .18s,box-shadow .18s;
  position:relative;
}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(20,39,63,.10)}
.card .tag{
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--tea);
}
.card-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.proj-item{cursor:pointer;transition:background .12s;border-radius:8px}
.proj-item:hover{background:rgba(36,70,110,.05)}
.badge{
  font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;border-radius:999px;
  padding:3px 9px;white-space:nowrap;flex:none;font-weight:500;
}
.badge.star{background:#7A1E1E;color:#FFE9C9}
.badge.bib{background:var(--persimmon);color:#fff}
.badge.gam{background:#8A2B3C;color:#FDE8EC}
.badge.ed{background:var(--straw);color:#5A4C2E}
.card .rec{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--indigo);font-weight:400;
  border-left:2px solid var(--persimmon);padding-left:9px;flex:none;
}
.info-row{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;
  font-size:12px;color:#55677E;flex:none;
}
.card-link{
  font-size:12px;color:var(--indigo);text-decoration:none;
  border-bottom:1px dashed var(--indigo);margin-right:10px;
}
.card-link:hover{color:var(--persimmon);border-color:var(--persimmon)}
.card h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:1px}
.card p{font-size:13px;color:#55677E;font-weight:300;flex:1}
.card .meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:#7A8AA0;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);padding-top:10px}
.star-btn{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;color:#B9C4D2;transition:color .15s;line-height:1}
.star-btn.on{color:var(--persimmon)}
.demo-note{padding:0 34px 40px;font-size:12px;color:#8A97A8;max-width:880px}

/* ---------- Views (starred / projects) ---------- */
.view{display:none}
.view.show{display:block}
.view-inner{padding:48px 34px 60px;max-width:760px}
.view-inner h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:6px}
.view-inner .sub{color:#5B6B80;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:26px}
.plain-list{list-style:none}
.plain-list li{
  padding:15px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;
}
.plain-list li b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:1px}
.plain-list li span{font-size:13px;color:#5B6B80;font-weight:300}
.plain-list li small{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#8A97A8;flex:none}
.empty{color:#8A97A8;font-weight:300;padding:26px 4px}

/* ---------- Chat icon ---------- */
.chat-fab{
  position:fixed;right:26px;bottom:26px;z-index:40;
  width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--indigo);color:#FAF6EE;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,39,63,.35);
  transition:transform .15s,background .15s;
}
.chat-fab:hover{transform:scale(1.06);background:var(--indigo-soft)}
.chat-fab svg{width:26px;height:26px}

/* ---------- Immersive chat (no bubbles) ---------- */
.chat-layer{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:20;
  background:var(--rice);
  display:none;flex-direction:column;
}
.chat-layer.open{display:flex}
.chat-head{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  padding:16px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rice) 88%,transparent);
}
.chat-head b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:2px}
.chat-head span{font-size:12px;color:#7A8AA0}
.chat-close{
  margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:8px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;
  color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);
}
.chat-close:hover{border-color:var(--indigo);color:var(--indigo)}
.key-row{
  display:none;gap:8px;align-items:center;
  padding:10px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:#FFF9EF;
}
.key-row.show{display:flex}
.key-row input{
  flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
  padding:7px 10px;font-family:var(--body);font-size:13px;
  background:#fff;color:var(--ink);outline:none;
}
.key-row input:focus{border-color:var(--indigo)}
.chat-scroll{flex:1;overflow-y:auto}
.chat-doc{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:44px 26px 30px}
.turn{margin-bottom:34px}
.turn .who{
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.turn.user .who{color:var(--tea)}
.turn.ai .who{color:var(--persimmon)}
.turn .who::after{
  content:"";flex:1;height:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,currentColor,transparent);opacity:.3;
}
.turn.user .text{font-weight:500;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.turn.ai .text{font-weight:300;font-size:15.5px;color:#2A3B52;white-space:pre-wrap}
.turn.ai .text strong{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}
.thinking{display:flex;gap:5px;padding:4px 0}
.thinking i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--persimmon);opacity:.4;animation:pulse 1.2s infinite}
.thinking i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}
.thinking i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.25;transform:translateY(0)}50%{opacity:.9;transform:translateY(-3px)}}

.chat-input-wrap{
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rice) 92%,#fff);
  padding:16px 26px 20px;
}
.chat-input{
  max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;
  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
  padding:10px 12px;
  transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s;
}
.chat-input:focus-within{border-color:var(--indigo);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(36,70,110,.10)}
.chat-input textarea{
  flex:1;border:none;outline:none;resize:none;
  font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;
  max-height:130px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);
}
.send-btn{
  background:var(--persimmon);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:10px;
  width:38px;height:38px;cursor:pointer;flex:none;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  transition:opacity .15s;
}
.send-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}
.hint{max-width:680px;margin:8px auto 0;font-size:11.5px;color:#93A0B1;text-align:center}

/* ---------- Suggested prompts ---------- */
.starters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:14px}
.starters button{
  border:1px dashed var(--line);background:transparent;border-radius:10px;
  padding:8px 13px;font-size:13px;color:#44556C;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--body);
  transition:all .15s;
}
.starters button:hover{border-color:var(--persimmon);color:var(--persimmon)}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:820px){
  .app{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .sidebar{
    position:fixed;inset:0 30% 0 0;z-index:60;min-width:250px;
    transform:translateX(-102%);transition:transform .22s ease;
    box-shadow:14px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }
  .sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0)}
  .menu-btn{display:inline-flex}
  .hero,.chips,.grid,.wind,.demo-note,.view-inner{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}
  .topbar{padding:12px 20px}
  .chat-doc{padding:30px 18px 24px}
  .chat-head,.chat-input-wrap{padding-left:18px;padding-right:18px}
}
.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,20,34,.4);z-index:55;display:none}
.scrim.show{display:block}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--persimmon);outline-offset:2px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">

  <!-- ======= 左側欄 ======= -->
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="側邊選單">
    <div class="brand"><b>竹北食堂</b><span>ZHUBEI</span></div>

    <button class="new-chat" id="newChatBtn">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
      新對話
    </button>

    <div class="nav-label">記 錄</div>
    <nav id="historyNav">
      <button class="nav-item" data-hist="0"><span class="dot"></span>光明商圈晚餐口袋名單</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-hist="1"><span class="dot"></span>帶長輩吃客家菜怎麼選</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-hist="2"><span class="dot"></span>宵夜：文興路還開著的店</button>
    </nav>

    <div class="nav-label">已加星號</div>
    <button class="nav-item" data-view="starred">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l2.9 6.3 6.9.8-5.1 4.7 1.4 6.8L12 17.3 5.9 20.6l1.4-6.8L2.2 9.1l6.9-.8z"/></svg>
      我的星號店家 <small id="starCount">0</small>
    </button>

    <div class="nav-label">專 案</div>
    <button class="nav-item" data-proj="0">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 012-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
      米其林巡禮 2026
    </button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-proj="1">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 012-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
      異國料理地圖
    </button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-proj="2">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 012-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
      在地經典麵食
    </button>
    <button class="nav-item" data-view="home">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 11l9-8 9 8M5 10v10h14V10"/></svg>
      回到首頁
    </button>

    <div class="side-foot">九降風起・柿餅正甜<br>竹北食堂 © 2026</div>
  </aside>
  <div class="scrim" id="scrim"></div>

  <!-- ======= 主區 ======= -->
  <main class="main" id="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="開啟選單">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
      </button>
      <span class="crumbs" id="crumbs">竹北食堂 / 精選</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 首頁 -->
    <section class="view show" id="view-home">
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="eyebrow">新竹縣・竹北市 HSINCHU COUNTY</div>
        <h1>九降風吹過的餐桌，<br>從<em>客家灶下</em>到深夜麵攤。</h1>
        <p>2026 年，米其林指南首度落腳新竹縣，第一顆星就亮在竹北。從摘星的江戶前壽司、必比登的新客家蔬食，到光明商圈的一碗牛肉麵——這張餐桌，比你想的更深。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wind" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>

      <div class="chips" id="chips">
        <button class="chip on" data-cat="all">全部</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="michelin">米其林・必比登</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="cn">中式</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="jp">日本料理</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="it">義大利</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="sp">西班牙・地中海</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="west">西式・餐酒</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="in">印度</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="veg">蔬食</button>
      </div>

      <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
      <p class="demo-note">＊店家資料整理自《臺灣米其林指南 2026》公開名單與各食評媒體報導（2026 年 8 月）。價位為約略區間、營業資訊可能異動，訂位與菜單請以店家公告為準。「編輯推薦／在地推薦」為本站整理之推薦標記，非官方評鑑。</p>
    </section>

    <!-- 星號 -->
    <section class="view" id="view-starred">
      <div class="view-inner">
        <h2>已加星號</h2>
        <p class="sub">你在卡片上點星號的店家，會集中收在這裡。</p>
        <ul class="plain-list" id="starList"></ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 專案 -->
    <section class="view" id="view-projects">
      <div class="view-inner" id="projWrap"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======= 沈浸式對話層（無氣泡） ======= -->
    <div class="chat-layer" id="chatLayer" role="dialog" aria-label="美食對話">
      <div class="chat-head">
        <b>食通</b><span id="modeBadge">竹北美食嚮導・示範模式</span>
        <button class="chat-close" id="keyBtn" title="設定 Anthropic API Key">API Key</button>
        <button class="chat-close" id="chatClose">收起</button>
      </div>
      <div class="key-row" id="keyRow">
        <input type="password" id="keyInput" placeholder="貼上 Anthropic API Key（僅存於本頁記憶體，重新整理即清除）">
        <button class="chat-close" id="keySave">套用</button>
        <button class="chat-close" id="keyClear">清除</button>
      </div>
      <div class="chat-scroll" id="chatScroll">
        <div class="chat-doc" id="chatDoc">
          <div class="turn ai">
            <div class="who">食 通</div>
            <div class="text">你好，我是「食通」，竹北的美食嚮導。跟我說人數、預算、想吃的口味，或直接問「今晚吃什麼」，我幫你想。
            <div class="starters">
              <button data-q="竹北有哪些米其林推薦的餐廳？">米其林・必比登名單</button>
              <button data-q="想吃義大利菜，約會和家庭聚餐各推薦哪間？">義大利菜怎麼選</button>
              <button data-q="西班牙菜和印度料理各推薦哪一間？">西班牙・印度料理</button>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
